1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,570
Uh, fish you could do carpentry with?

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:06,300
(Sheldon:)Why Leonard is such an attractive
and desirable boyfriend?

3
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,680
(Sheldon:)Pick one, your choice.

4
00:00:09,349 --> 00:00:10,479
(Amy:)Sheldon...

5
00:00:10,650 --> 00:00:12,980
(Sheldon:)Did you know that Leonard
has a perfect driving record...

6
00:00:13,153 --> 00:00:16,483
(Sheldon:)...and enjoys the insurance discounts
that go along with that?

7
00:00:16,656 --> 00:00:18,526
Hubba, hubba.

8
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:22,690
- Okay, go home, crazy man.
- You...

9
00:00:22,863 --> 00:00:27,093
(Sheldon:)Did you know that while Leonard is not
considered a tall fellow in our country...

10
00:00:27,267 --> 00:00:29,927
(Sheldon:)...in today's North Korea,
he's downright average?

11
00:00:31,505 --> 00:00:33,265
(Sheldon:)Talk about a keeper.

12
00:00:34,775 --> 00:00:36,365
(Penny:)Okay, what did Amy tell you?

13
00:00:36,576 --> 00:00:39,946
(Sheldon:)Oh, very well. I can't keep up
this clever charade any longer.

14
00:00:41,615 --> 00:00:44,515
(Sheldon:)She told me that you were thinking
of ending it with Leonard.

15
00:00:45,619 --> 00:00:49,319
Okay, listen to me. It's really sweet
you're trying to protect your friend...

16
00:00:49,489 --> 00:00:51,549
(Penny:)...but this is none of your business.
Got it?

17
00:00:51,725 --> 00:00:55,325
(Howard:)Excuse me,
this is not about protecting my friend.

18
00:00:59,533 --> 00:01:03,023
(Sheldon:)I'm a big fan of homeostasis.

